"""Single source of truth for the enidsdigitalhub Interior Style Library.

16 core styles + 2 signature colour stories. Everything (quiz, guides, pins, listings)
is generated from this file. Profile axes, each 0-1:
  color   neutral -> bold          rustic  sleek -> raw/rustic
  decor   minimal -> maximal       warmth  cool -> warm
  era     modern -> vintage/classic mood   light & airy -> moody & dark
  green   few plants -> jungle
"""

def P(*rows): return [dict(hex=h, name=n, use=u) for h, n, u in rows]

